@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070/v1

### Clear all rows, reset identity sequences, and refresh the AI status constraint
POST {{baseUrl}}/populate/reset

### Create the CUSTOMER, STAFF, and OWNER roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/populate/roles

### Create or promote the local Owner accounts (password: Password12345!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/populate/owners

### Create STAFF
POST {{baseUrl}}/populate/staff